    {
        "Id": 153,
        "ActionId": 153,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "Suma",
            "Guiding the Corrupted? Sounds desperate. I bet Leon and the rest came up with it, didn't they?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 154,
        "ActionId": 154,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "They did propose it, but everyone in the camp agreed to it.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 155,
        "ActionId": 155,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Suma",
            "Does that include me? Well, you know me best—I agree with their plan. Given what I saw there, who knows what will happen if we don't act now?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 156,
        "ActionId": 156,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Suma",
            "So, how do we do it?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 157,
        "ActionId": 157,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "We've decided to blow it up.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 158,
        "ActionId": 158,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "That giant mechanoid buried under the sand can get infected at any moment, but we're running out of time with how close the Corrupted are. It might not be elegant, but it will solve the problem.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 159,
        "ActionId": 159,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "It's faster to show them the danger than to convince them of one.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 160,
        "ActionId": 160,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "We'll act when the Corrupted Colossus activates. We can't give them enough time to pack, unfortunately. I'm just glad that their most important supplies aren't in that camp.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 161,
        "ActionId": 161,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Suma",
            "And you're planning to infect the mechanoid?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 162,
        "ActionId": 162,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "The IUSL construction mech isn't sand-resistant, so it won't function even if it turns on. Without anything to dig it up while their camp sits directly on top of it, we can't disassemble it before it gets infected as we often do. It's just a threat now.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 163,
        "ActionId": 163,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "The only plan we could come up with at the end was to infect it so it'd reveal itself and its weak points. Then we can dismantle it.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 164,
        "ActionId": 164,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "Obviously, we can't let anyone at their camp get injured—that's the purpose of our whole operation. I've formed a rescue team to make sure people get out safely.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 165,
        "ActionId": 165,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "And the key to tearing the mechanoid apart is your expertise—explosives.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 166,
        "ActionId": 166,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Suma",
            "Bombs, huh? My stuff packs a punch, but even the biggest bomb is not enough to knock a construction mech down in an instant. That is unless we can target its weak points accurately.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 167,
        "ActionId": 167,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "Today's your lucky day. We know exactly where the mechanoid's Achilles heel is. We have another expert with us.",
            2
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 168,
        "ActionId": 168,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Watanabe",
            "Hey, Zachery! Come here for a second.",
